  /* ---------- Brand blue (refined for dark) ----------
     Every filled CTA takes #0060dd — Juejin's OWN active-state blue (its
     `.confirm-btn:visited`), not the raw #1e80ff resting hex. Same hue family,
     site-authentic, and it carries a white 14px/400 label at 5.65:1 where the
     verbatim #1e80ff manages only 3.76:1. Accent LINES (the booklet tab underline,
     the checked-checkbox tick) keep #1e80ff — they are graphical, not text. */
  .login-button,
