     the inline `.login-btn`, the comment-box `.login-guide-button`, the booklet
     `.book-buy-button` and the share-modal `.short-btn`) fill from
     `--juejin-brand-1-normal`, which we remap to the light accent used for TEXT.
     That painted them pale #5fb0e6 with white labels (2.4:1). They ship natively as
     #1e80ff/#fff, so restore the brand fill on the exact button subset — at the same
     #0060dd the block above uses, so no CTA is a different blue from its neighbour.
     The already-followed state stays a ghost button. */
  .animation-follow-btn,
  .follow-btn,
  .jj-follow-button.follow,
  .follow-text,
  .login-btn,
  .item-login-button,
  .login-guide-button,
  .book-buy-button,
  .short-box .short-btn {
