  /* The rendered gutter number is `.code-block-extension-codeLine::before`
     (content: attr(...)) — pseudo TEXT with no text node, so no `color` walk sees
     it. It kept a #808080 grey = 4.2:1 on the code surface, under AA. */
  .code-block-extension-codeLine::before {
    color: #8b949e !important;
