     Both tokens are already remapped correctly — it was the blanket chip rule above
     that painted BOTH states the same fill and the same blue label, leaving the two
     distinguishable only by a 1px border. Hand each state back its own look.
     (Scoped to `.course-header`: the `.dislike-menu` tag chips are also `.tag-item`
