     blanket chip rule above flattened its native red (`--juejin-danger-1-normal`
     #f64242) fill to the grey chip surface, erasing the "new" signal. It carries a
     white label, so restore a deepened danger red (white reads 5.6:1, same move the
     header HOT badge makes). Higher specificity than `.tag` so it wins outright. */
  span.new-tag-wrap,
  .new-tag-wrap.tag,
  .new-tag-wrap {
